<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Destroys the specified object unless it is a party member; is plot or is immortal.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>The reason for this function: there were accidents where creatures would deplete themselves as Ammo because people were not paying attention.
</p>
